  "problem": "Fill in the correct options below to solve the congruence $22x≡5\\,(\\text{mod}\\,51).$\n\nSince $\\text{gcd}(22,51)=$\n{{field-1}}, \nusing the extended Euclidean algorithm, we get \n\n| $1\\,=\\,22\\,\\cdot ($\n{{field-2}}\n$)+\\,51\\,\\cdot ($\n{{field-3}}\n$).$ |\n| --- |\n\nTherefore, expressed as a nonnegative integer smaller than $51,$ the solution to the congruence is  \n\n| $x≡$\n{{field-4}}\n$(\\text{mod}\\,51).$ |\n| --- |",
